id: pm-vcs-bisect-shallow-report
title: Preserve bisect reports when the culprit is a shallow boundary
description: "A bisect verdict whose first bad commit is a shallow merge parent cannot be enriched because linkedItems unconditionally reads the omitted first parent. Range construction succeeds, but manual bad and subsequent status return object_not_found. This is a separate provenance-reporting path discovered during PR 131 review round 3, beyond the requested ancestry and checkout fixes."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
